WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.680
New Chapter is a GLP-1 lifestyle tool with
a personal AI coach.

00:06.020 --> 00:07.620
Everything in one place.

00:08.500 --> 00:14.950
The tracker comes to Google Play in
December to early January, and to the
Apple App Store in February.

00:15.300 --> 00:16.650
Cancel anytime.

00:16.860 --> 00:18.400
Start by logging your shot.

00:19.020 --> 00:21.940
Then water and movement, and your weight.

00:22.660 --> 00:24.520
Then food, when you are ready.

00:25.120 --> 00:27.380
Your journey, one day at a time.

